Cognitive $C_t$ 7 days 30 days Delirium vs. MCI
Social $S_t$ 14 days 60 days Grief vs. isolation
Decisional $D_t$ 7 days 30 days Acute stress vs. capacity loss

Escalation: Continue observation → increase monitoring → recommend clinical evaluation. FunctionalDeviation ≠ MedicalDiagnosis.

7.4 Construct Stratification

Four distinct quantities are separated:

1. Clinical threshold: Smallest clinically meaningful change in SMAF.
2. Measurement error: Standard error of measurement (SEM).
3. Minimal detectable change: $\text{MDC}_{95} = 1.96\sqrt{2} \cdot \text{SEM}$.
4. Algorithmic decision threshold: Set at MDC or calibrated to desired sensitivity/specificity.

