Appendix H — Simulation Generative Model

H.1 Archetype Transition Parameters

Archetype $f_{\text{arch}}$ (P, C, S, D) $\mathbf{W}_{\text{arch}}$ structure
Stable $(-0.02, -0.01, -0.01, -0.01)$/yr Diagonal-dominant, weak off-diagonal
